OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fbuilding from the west through the
OL,7,Fevening, some turning heavy and
OL,8,Fbringing the risk of hail and thunder,
OL,9,Fmostly in the west. Southwest wind
OL,10,Fstrong in north and west.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FBrighter spells and
OL,13,Fscattered showers through to mid-
OL,14,Fafternoon. Showers building from the
OL,15,Fwest after mid-afternoon, bringing the
OL,16,Frisk of hail and thunder from the
OL,17,Fevening, chiefly across western
OL,18,Fdistricts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
