OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,6,FUnsettled for Sunday with showers or
OL,7,Flonger periods of rain, with Inverness
OL,8,Fseeing best of the shelter. A few
OL,9,Flight scattered showers on Monday.
OL,10,FTuesday turning wet and windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
